  should make sure that the <term>클립베이스</term> is empty before
  importing. (<menu>Edit / Empty Clipbase</menu>).
  </p>
  <p>
  다음 단계는 방금 열린 scidCommunity 데이터베이스의 트리를 여는 것입니다.
  Then a new <term>마스크</term> should be created or an existing one
  opened. <b>메모</b> that this function may be used to consolidate
